{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026TeScrRNIQz1793069180.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>視帝譚俊彥近日與太太任祉妍暫時放下手頭工作，雙雙飛往越南富國島享受陽光與海灘。日前，任祉妍在社交平台上大方分享了一系列旅行花絮靚相，並配文寫道：「Traded tantrums for tides. Recharging by the vitamin sea. 🤎💛🥂」，大派健康性感福利。</p><p></p><p>從曝光的照片可見，任祉妍以一身黑色一件頭水著上陣，頭戴草帽兼配襯太陽眼鏡，躺在沙灘椅上展露甜美笑容；而身旁的譚俊彥則赤膊上陣。兩公婆在鏡頭前緊緊依偎合照，恩愛程度爆表，整個畫面洋溢着滿滿的甜蜜氣息。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"0497e9ab-dde4-4f9f-94b5-d6eafc9169dd.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026DIbe3C5xjC1793069179.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了這波閃光彈外，譚俊彥在旅程中更化身太太的「御用攝影師」，親自為對方操刀拍攝靚相。任祉妍其後在限時動態特別晒出一張由老公拍攝的休閒照，在獨特的拍攝角度下，完美展現出她的修長美腿。她更幽默發文大讚老公的攝影功力：「俾大家睇下譚生嘅攝影技術有幾勁，我其實有兩層樓咁高。😎」，兩人私下互動充滿情趣，足證夫妻感情極為深厚。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"06a35eae-9e61-4f12-b8f1-f61167fe7c45.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026tIo8xc0NV31793069179.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.646809+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:18:28.985975+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:28.760354+00:00","content_hash":"e3e5b671a9ba6782f225ca1b83db6b527e4c3f13336f5c61aca9ae2c0c482abc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.646809+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}